{"summary":"Mahjong 3! Match and remove all tiles from the tower. \nEnjoy three game modes.","description":"Presenting new title by 1C Wireless – Mahjong 3!\n\nThere are three game modes for you to enjoy:\n\n• Classic - Original Mahjong Solitaire. Play as long as you want!\n• Time Attack - Clear all matching tiles as quick as possible!\n• Challenge - For Advanced players. You have limited time to choose your Tiles. The faster you select the Tiles, the higher will be your score for the move!\n\nFull version without commercial advertising.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Large and clear graphics of mahjong tiles! Best for your eyes!\n• Full undo!\n• Different backgrounds and themes!\n• New super SHUFFLE feature when no more moves are available!\n• Hints: possible moves can be highlighted!\n\nThis solitaire game is also known as Mahjong Solitaire, Taipei Mahjongg, Shanghai Mah-Jong, Chinese Mahjong, Mahjong Trails, Mahjong Titans, Kyodai.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7rvQf98awq4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l3hj8FATWxT0eI_a0W807EK1YFVQR_-dSPSUyWUvUbarcc4FTUQU6-rTUrZl7x4cRU2LLNEd64Ymd7qqNW-SJQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gPGMSuDu9Kg07pHJwJb3jIJ-FMtgM-euTUiFLt2cFrIF4MEmSHT0v_Hf6Oy4pBEI00o4uT-2eko18ZzpLoL20_8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wpAHGAar3Z1DPipjBH_IERuvJDrBTuQIS35cswawaFPv1Wb2cpTHO_CU4fhFc0G5tSvY5WYKw1u6pu1txyIEUQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/us6liT3sVL7YXhI0rJMTIJRXJ1k6v70TfKcg30UvCzitl2iDVVQsoWXOawj5mk51HJEwSG8xSI-lUsLVh8JiYg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bPLXVlpm3i7-3jQAkGEglgBmbljeEabDDV7pJLfPJdi8Vw3wTBEWLdtfHcpIiVzN9wDMyxUG0AC2oGQOk7jcvYo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JMnYO3m9C3yLkIHx3P-BWnnmx9lWy2DRn6eybGhtMCKA96ENXBpHDnD3NMgKIuqvMtlOA6uxn_1Xkw58-qTZMxM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xLPdTZ-gEfSa2MCywdgqZXpTiKGMvlwzkijPw7_aDRu7mKGQX0bcYBubHt-qs4nBqQPHjmHGfWl7Kh4yAomWPQ","https: